  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Stablecoin market cap rose 2.4% over 30D:</strong> Stablecoin market cap at $304.86B (2.4% higher over 30D) implies fresh dry powder entering crypto rails\u2014usually a constructive backdrop for settlement, trading, and on-chain cash demand. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/fragmented-regulations-limit-stablecoin-adoption-in-international-finance-wto-director?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Fragmented regulations limit stablecoin adoption in international finance: WTO head</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li><li><strong>Stablecoin market structure remains concentration-led:</strong> leadership is still defined by a small set of large issuers/platforms; share shifts matter as much as aggregate market-cap growth. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/09/14/banks-escalate-stablecoin-rewards-fight-as-senate-prepares-for-a-clarity-act-vote\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Banks escalate stablecoin rewards fight as Senate prepares for a Clarity Act vote</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Policy and reserves are resetting issuer priorities:</strong> Issuer and platform share can shift before aggregate market cap does, because policy and reserve quality determine which names institutions will hold. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/09/14/sec-s-atkins-backs-clarity-act-but-says-agency-will-keep-pushing-crypto-rules-without-it\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SEC&#x27;s Atkins backs Clarity Act but says agency will keep pushing crypto rules without it</a> (CoinDesk).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
